('0762154001', '0762154', 'Torje xplorer parka', 'Hoodie', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Yellow', 'Medium', 'Jacket Casual', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Mens Outerwear', 'Outdoor', 'Padded, quilted jacket in woven fabric with a fabric patch on the chest, a padded, lined drawstring hood and an adjustable tab with press-studs at the top. Two-way zip down the front with a chin guard and a wind flap with concealed press-studs. Chest pockets with a concealed zip, flap front pockets with concealed press-studs, concealed side pockets behind the front pockets and one inner pocket with a hook and loop fastening. Adjustable tabs with press-studs at the cuffs and a concealed drawstring at the hem. Lined. Polyester filling.', NULL, 0, 0),
