('0774679002', '0774679', 'Jacket Trucker Belted', 'Jacket', 'Garment Upper body', 'Denim', 'Blue', 'Medium Dusty', 'Denim Other Garments', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Ladies Denim', 'Trousers Denim', 'Wide jacket in a longer style in soft, washed denim with worn details. Collar, buttons down the front and a detachable tie belt to accentuate the waist. Buttoned cuffs, side pockets and flap chest pockets with a button. The cotton content of the jacket is partly recycled.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0774679003', '0774679', 'Jacket Trucker Belted', 'Jacket', 'Garment Upper body', 'Denim', 'Light Blue', 'Dusty Light', 'Denim Other Garments', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Ladies Denim', 'Trousers Denim', 'Wide jacket in a longer style in soft, washed denim with worn details. Collar, buttons down the front and a detachable tie belt to accentuate the waist. Buttoned cuffs, side pockets and flap chest pockets with a button. The cotton content of the jacket is partly recycled.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0774683001', '0774683', 'Jacket Slim Pile', 'Jacket', 'Garment Upper body', 'Denim', 'Dark Blue', 'Medium Dusty', 'Everyday Waredrobe Denim', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladies Denim', 'Trousers Denim', 'Jacket in washed denim with metal buttons, a pile-lined collar and buttons down the front. Flap chest pockets with a button, welt side pockets and buttoned cuffs. Pile lining. The jacket is made partly from recycled cotton.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0774696001', '0774696', 'MERCURY slim fit denim shirt', 'Shirt', 'Garment Upper body', 'Denim', 'Dark Blue', 'Bright', 'Shirt', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Shirts', 'Shirt in washed cotton denim with a button-down collar, classic front and open chest pocket. Long sleeves with adjustable buttoning at the cuffs, a yoke with a pleat at the back, and a gently rounded hem. Slim Fit – a fit with narrow shoulders and a tapered waist for a fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
