('0781774001', '0781774', 'September PaddedSoftbra straps', 'Bra', 'Underwear', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Expressive Lingerie', 'Lingeries/Tights', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Lingerie', 'Under-, Nightwear', 'Soft, non-wired bra in lace with narrow crossover elastic straps at the front and cups with removable inserts that shape the bust and provide good support. Adjustable shoulder straps and a hook-and-eye fastening at the back.', NULL, 0, 0),
