('0782071001', '0782071', 'Rambo lace playsuit', 'Jumpsuit/Playsuit', 'Garment Full body', 'Lace', 'Dark Turquoise', 'Dark', 'Jersey', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Tailoring', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Sleeveless lace playsuit in a double layer at the top with a cut-out section at the back, concealed press-studs at the back of the neck and a concealed zip at the back. Jersey lining.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0782072001', '0782072', 'Treacle lace playsuit', 'Jumpsuit/Playsuit', 'Garment Full body', 'Lace', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Jersey', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Tailoring', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Playsuit in jersey crêpe with a yoke and short sleeves in lace. V-neck with a sewn-in wrapover at the top, side pockets, and a seam at the waist with pleats and a sewn-in tie belt.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0782073001', '0782073', 'Beetroot jumpsuit.', 'Jumpsuit/Playsuit', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Jersey', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Tailoring', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Ankle-length jumpsuit in airy jersey crêpe with a V-neck, wrapover top with gentle draping and a seam and sewn-in tie belt at the waist. Cap sleeves, side pockets and gently tapered legs with pleats at the top. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0782079001', '0782079', 'CW Fori Jacquard Kaftan', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Glittering/Metallic', 'Light Pink', 'Dusty Light', 'Limited Edition', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'LIMITED EDITION. Kaftan in an airy weave containing glittery threads with a round, pleated neckline. Opening at the front with ties at the top, a decorative drawstring on the shoulders and cap sleeves. Two box pleats at the back for added width, and slits in the sides. Chiffon underdress.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0782084001', '0782084', 'CW Bobbi Frill Kaftan', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Dark Pink', 'Dark', 'Limited Edition', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'LIMITED EDITION. Kaftan dress in patterned satin with a frill-trimmed V-neck and wide, 3/4-length sleeves with a flounced trim. Gathered, concealed elastication at the waist to create soft draping. Slightly longer at the back. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0782088001', '0782088', 'CW Letty Jacquard Dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Jacquard', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Limited Edition', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'LIMITED EDITION. Dress in an airy weave with a glittery thread pattern. Frill-trimmed stand-up collar, an opening with ties at the top and long balloon sleeves with buttoned cuffs. Seam at the waist with a drawstring that ties at one side. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0782090001', '0782090', 'CW Saga Jacquard Dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Jacquard', 'Beige', 'Medium Dusty', 'Limited Edition', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'LIMITED EDITION. Wide dress in an airy jacquard weave with a sheen. Small stand-up collar, a V-neck opening at the front with wide ties and wide sleeves with narrow, concealed elastication and a flounce at the cuffs.Softly draping skirt with frill-trimmed tiers. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0782096003', '0782096', 'Monster blazer', 'Blazer', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Suit', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Tailoring', 'Dressed', 'Fitted jacket in slightly stretchy fabric with a satin shawl lapels, a covered button at the front and flap front pockets. Decorative, covered buttons at the cuffs, and a single back vent. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0782097001', '0782097', 'CW Vort Drawstring Dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Orange', 'Medium', 'Limited Edition', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'LIMITED EDITION. Long dress in a crêpe weave with a V-neck, pleated top, cap sleeves with a decorative drawstring on the shoulders, and a concealed zip at the back. Inset panel at the waist and a wide, softly draping skirt with a frill-trimmed seam and flared flounce to the hem. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0782100001', '0782100', 'CW Iman Silk Blouse', 'Blouse', 'Garment Upper body', 'Mixed solid/pattern', 'Light Pink', 'Dusty Light', 'Limited Edition', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'LIMITED EDITION. Blouse in silk with a sheen, with concealed buttons down the front and lace sections on the shoulders. Long dolman sleeves, wide, gently rounded cuffs with a covered button, and a gently rounded hem.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0782103001', '0782103', 'CW Meta Embroidery Top', 'Top', 'Garment Upper body', 'Embroidery', 'Beige', 'Medium Dusty', 'Limited Edition', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'LIMITED EDITION. Straight-cut, double-layered top in airy viscose and chiffon crêpe with zigzag edges. Concealed zip at the back, a round neckline and loose, narrow beaded fringes at the top. Slightly longer at the back.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0782106001', '0782106', 'CW ABB Chiffong Blouse', 'Blouse', 'Garment Upper body', 'Embroidery', 'Orange', 'Light', 'Limited Edition', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'LIMITED EDITION. Shorter-style blouse in crinkled, gathered chiffon. Double layer front and back, and sections in a sturdier weave at the yoke, cuffs and hem. Small opening with a covered button at the back of the neck, balloon sleeves, asymmetric cuffs with a covered button, and covered buttons at the sides of the hem.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0782109001', '0782109', 'CW Bien Frill Blouse', 'Blouse', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Limited Edition', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'LIMITED EDITION. Blouse in airy chiffon with a frilled stand-up collar, concealed buttons down the front and a frilled bib front. Long sleeves with vertical frills and wide, flared cuffs with a sparkly stone button and frill trim.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0782111001', '0782111', 'CW Nea Velvet Blazer', 'Blazer', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Limited Edition', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'LIMITED EDITION. Jacket in soft velour with soft notch lapels and a detachable tie belt at the waist. Patch front pockets, long sleeves with a slit at the cuffs, and a single back vent. Satin lining.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0782115001', '0782115', 'CW Zeni Asymetric Skirt', 'Skirt', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Orange', 'Medium', 'Limited Edition', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'LIMITED EDITION. Calf-length, asymmetric skirt in airy chiffon with pleats for added width and draping, and a concealed zip at the back. Chiffon underskirt.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0782116001', '0782116', 'CW Liz Taylor Trousers', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Beige', 'Medium Dusty', 'Limited Edition', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'LIMITED EDITION. Wide trousers in a crêpe weave with wide, covered elastication at the waist, side pockets and straight legs with double-layered hems. Partly lined in chiffon.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0782117001', '0782117', 'CW Thalia Velvet Trousers', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Limited Edition', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'LIMITED EDITION. Wide, ankle-length trousers in soft velour with a high waist, zip fly and extended waistband with concealed hook-and-eye fasteners. Side pockets, a low crotch and straight legs.', NULL, 0, 0),
