('0783767001', '0783767', 'BB Air Ski Pants', 'Outdoor trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Young Boy Outdoor', 'Children Sizes 134-170', 'Baby/Children', 'Kids Outerwear', 'Outdoor', 'Padded ski trousers in windproof, water-repellent, breathable functional fabric with closed, waterproof seams at critical points. Zip fly and press-stud, zipped side pockets, a flap back pocket with a press-stud, and reinforced hems with snow flaps. Detachable, adjustable elastic braces. Lined. The trousers have a water-repellent coating without fluorocarbons.', NULL, 0, 0),
