('0784274001', '0784274', 'CS Bengal', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Dress', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Everyday Collection', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Long dress in an airy weave with a V-neck, buttons at the top and a yoke with a crocheted lace trim front and back. Long, wide sleeves with narrow elastication at the cuffs and a wide flounce at the hem. Jersey underdress with narrow, adjustable shoulder straps.', NULL, 0, 0),
