('0789331001', '0789331', 'Lala Tunic', 'Blouse', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Light Beige', 'Dusty Light', 'Blouse & Dress', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Trend', 'Blouses', 'Tunic in a viscose and cupro weave with a collar and deep V-neck with a draped knot detail at the front. Seam at the waist, a wrapover lower section and long sleeves with a covered button at the cuffs. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789331003', '0789331', 'Lala Tunic', 'Blouse', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Dark Green', 'Medium', 'Blouse & Dress', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Trend', 'Blouses', 'Tunic in a viscose and cupro weave with a collar and deep V-neck with a draped knot detail at the front. Seam at the waist, a wrapover lower section and long sleeves with a covered button at the cuffs. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789349001', '0789349', 'LEO woven PJ', 'Pyjama set', 'Nightwear', 'Check', 'Red', 'Medium', 'Young Girl UW/NW', 'Children Sizes 134-170', 'Baby/Children', 'Girls Underwear & Basics', 'Under-, Nightwear', 'Pyjamas with a long-sleeved shirt and bottoms in soft cotton flannel with decorative piping. Shirt with a collar, buttons down the front, an open chest pocket and a rounded hem. Bottoms with covered elastication at the waist.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789353001', '0789353', 'SC ENCHANTED jacket', 'Jacket', 'Garment Upper body', 'Stripe', 'Dark Red', 'Dark', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Oversized, straight-cut, double-breasted jacket in a brushed wool blend with peak lapels and front pockets. Dropped shoulders, straight, long sleeves with fringes at the back, and a fringed hem. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789355001', '0789355', 'SC WICCAN blazer', 'Blazer', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Fitted, single-breasted jacket in a wool blend with satin lapels and a concealed button at the front. Flap welt front pockets, an inner pocket with a button, concealed fasteners at the cuffs and a high-cut back vent. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789356001', '0789356', 'SC DOWN DOWN vest', 'Outdoor Waistcoat', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Long, padded gilet with a high shine. Padded, detachable hood, a chunky two-way zip down the front and a detachable tie belt that can be fastened in various ways. Two internal shoulder straps so you can wear the gilet around your shoulders. Concealed front pockets with a zip, and two inner pockets. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789359002', '0789359', 'SC HIA HIA dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Wide, airy dress in a softly draping weave made from recycled polyester. Stand-up collar with a fold-down edge, concealed buttons down the front and pin-tucks at the top. Extra-long sleeves with detachable buttoned cuffs, a seam at the hips and a wide, voluminous skirt. Longer at the back. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789361001', '0789361', 'SC MYSTIC dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Lace', 'Dark Beige', 'Medium Dusty', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Dress in airy, softly draping satin with lace details and hole embroidery. Lace-covered V-neck front and back, and cap sleeves. The dress is in a straight cut with gentle draping to the hem and has an asymmetric hem with a slit at the front. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789362001', '0789362', 'SC LOVA dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Short dress woven in a viscose blend with a slight sheen. Fitted at the top with a small grandad collar, pin-tucks at the front, yoke with a pleat at the back, and concealed buttons down the front. Long puff sleeves that define the shoulders and wide, buttoned cuffs. Seam at the waist and a gathered, voluminous balloon skirt. Lined in a cotton weave.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789363001', '0789363', 'SC ENERGY dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Colour blocking', 'Yellow', 'Medium', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Dress in softly draping jersey crêpe with a gathered seam at the front, extra-long sleeves and wide cuffs with a covered button. Heavily draping balloon skirt with an asymmetric hem. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789365001', '0789365', 'SC NAMASTE skirt', 'Skirt', 'Garment Lower body', 'Stripe', 'Dark Red', 'Dark', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Wrapover A-line skirt in a sturdy, brushed wool blend with a low waist, concealed press-studs and fringes down the front and a concealed hook-and-eye fastening on the inside. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789367001', '0789367', 'SC DARYL skirt', 'Skirt', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Short, flared skirt woven in a wool blend with decorative zigzag seams. High waist with a satin-lined waistband and a concealed zip and concealed hook-and-eye fastener at one side. Box pleat with an inset satin panel front and back, and open back pockets. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789368001', '0789368', 'SC ALWINA skirt', 'Skirt', 'Garment Lower body', 'All over pattern', 'Orange', 'Bright', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Calf-length, asymmetric skirt in an airy, patterned, pleated weave. High waist with a reinforced waistband, and a concealed zip and hook-and-eye fastener at one side. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789370001', '0789370', 'SC EASTWICK trouser', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Dark Beige', 'Medium Dusty', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Trousers in a sturdy, slightly stretchy weave made from a wool blend with a regular waist and tailored waistband. Zip fly with concealed hook-and-eye fasteners and gently flared legs with creases.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789374001', '0789374', 'SC RITUAL leather trouser', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Trousers in soft leather with a regular waist and fly with a concealed zip and concealed hook-and-eye fastener. Small flap front pockets with a press-stud, a back pocket and straight legs with visible seams and a slit at the hems. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789376001', '0789376', 'SC MALEFICIENT denim', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Denim', 'Dark Beige', 'Medium Dusty', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. 5-pocket jeans in washed organic cotton denim with a regular waist, zip fly and button and straight legs with a seam at the hems. The hems are reinforced with canvas on the inside and have a slit at the back and a raw edge.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789377001', '0789377', 'SC RITUAL trouser', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION/PREMIUM QUALITY. Trousers in a stretch weave made from a viscose blend with a regular waist and tailored waistband. Fly with a concealed zip and concealed hook-and-eye fastener, small flap front pockets with a press-stud, a fake back pocket and straight legs with a slit at the hems and sewn-in creases.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789379001', '0789379', 'SC MAGICA blouse', 'Blouse', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'White', 'Light', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Blouse in an airy cotton weave with concealed buttons down the front, a small stand-up collar with a fold-down edge, and pin-tucks at the front. Extra-long puff sleeves lined with tulle at the top to add volume and accentuate the shoulders, and wide, buttoned cuffs. Yoke with a bellows pleat at the back for added width, and a rounded hem.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789379002', '0789379', 'SC MAGICA blouse', 'Blouse', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Blouse in an airy cotton weave with concealed buttons down the front, a small stand-up collar with a fold-down edge, and pin-tucks at the front. Extra-long puff sleeves lined with tulle at the top to add volume and accentuate the shoulders, and wide, buttoned cuffs. Yoke with a bellows pleat at the back for added width, and a rounded hem.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789382003', '0789382', 'SC BELLATRIX shirt', 'Shirt', 'Garment Upper body', 'Lace', 'Dark Beige', 'Medium Dusty', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Long, fitted shirt in satin with lace sections. Large, pointed collar, buttons down the front, a tapered waist and extra-long sleeves with buttoned cuffs. Rounded hem with slits in the sides.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789383002', '0789383', 'SC BELLATRIX leather shirt', 'Shirt', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Dark Green', 'Dark', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Long, fitted shirt in soft leather with a large, pointed collar and covered press-studs down the front. Tapered waist with a seam, long sleeves, cuffs with covered press-studs, and a rounded hem. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789384002', '0789384', 'SC DEEP shirt', 'Shirt', 'Garment Upper body', 'All over pattern', 'Light Beige', 'Dusty Light', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Calf-length shirt in a textured viscose weave with a long, pointed collar, buttons down the front and a yoke with an inset pleat at the back for added width and soft draping. Extra-long sleeves with buttoned cuffs, and waist-high slits at the front.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789387001', '0789387', 'Apples Dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Light Yellow', 'Light', 'Blouse & Dress', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Trend', 'Blouses', 'Sleeveless, knee-length dress in a jacquard weave with a V-neck and adjustable spaghetti shoulder straps. Seam below the bust, a concealed zip in one side and a flared, pleated skirt with a wide flounce at the hem. Lined at the top.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789388001', '0789388', 'SC BLAIR sequin top', 'Top', 'Garment Upper body', 'Sequin', 'Light Grey', 'Dusty Light', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Top in sequined mesh with a round neckline, concealed zip at the back and long ties at the hem. Satin lining.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789389001', '0789389', 'SC HORN jersey top', 'Top', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Long top in soft, airy jersey made from a viscose and cotton blend with decorative flatlock seams in a contrasting colour. Extra-long sleeves with raw edges at the cuffs, and a raw-edge hem with slits in the sides.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789390001', '0789390', 'SC MEFISTA jersey polo', 'Top', 'Garment Upper body', 'All over pattern', 'Light Beige', 'Dusty Light', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Long top in airy wool jersey with extra-long sleeves and a rounded hem with slits in the sides.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789390003', '0789390', 'SC MEFISTA jersey polo', 'Top', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Yellow', 'Medium', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Long top in airy wool jersey with extra-long sleeves and a rounded hem with slits in the sides.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789391001', '0789391', 'SC ANGEL top', 'Top', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Silver', 'Light', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Straight-cut top in softly draping stretch jersey with a metallic-coloured coating. Draped polo neck with an opening at the back that can be fastened with a concealed hook-and-eye fastener, and extra-long sleeves. Concealed zip at the back and a rounded hem with slits in the sides.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789392001', '0789392', 'SC PAIN sequin polo', 'Top', 'Garment Upper body', 'Sequin', 'Light Grey', 'Dusty Light', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Top in stretch, sequined mesh with a draped polo neck with a concealed zip at the back. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789393003', '0789393', 'SC HOCUS POCUS tee', 'T-shirt', 'Garment Upper body', 'All over pattern', 'Light Beige', 'Dusty Light', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Slightly wider, straight-cut T-shirt in organic cotton jersey with decorative stitching around the sleeves and hem.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789394002', '0789394', 'SC URSULA sweater', 'Sweater', 'Garment Upper body', 'Colour blocking', 'Yellow', 'Medium', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Shorter-style top in scuba fabric with a stand-up collar, and block-coloured sections outlined with flatlock seams. Dropped shoulders, long sleeves and a tapered hem.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789395001', '0789395', 'SC POMPERIPOSSA knit', 'Sweater', 'Garment Upper body', 'Colour blocking', 'Light Beige', 'Dusty Light', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Short jumper knitted in a wool and cashmere blend with a stand-up collar and textured-knit shoulder sections. Visible, decorative stitching at the front, back and hem.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789397004', '0789397', 'SC GOTHICA knit', 'Sweater', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Dark Red', 'Dark', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Jumper knitted in a wool and cashmere blend with decorative seams. Deep V-neck at the front, a small V-neck at the back, long, wide sleeves and a straight hem. The jumper has a wide silhouette at the top and tapers to the hem.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789398001', '0789398', 'SC KICKI knit', 'Sweater', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Off White', 'Dusty Light', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Jumper in a soft, fine-knit wool blend containing some cashmere with contrasting colour flatlock seams and vertical seams front and back. Ribbed stand-up collar, ribbing at the cuffs and hem, and high slits in the sides.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789399001', '0789399', 'SC BRIGHT knit', 'Sweater', 'Garment Upper body', 'Colour blocking', 'Yellow', 'Medium', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Wide, polo-neck jumper in a wool knit with dropped shoulders and straight, extra-long sleeves. Twisted seams at the front to create a tapered silhouette, and an asymmetric hem.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789399002', '0789399', 'SC BRIGHT knit', 'Sweater', 'Garment Upper body', 'Colour blocking', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Wide, polo-neck jumper in a wool knit with dropped shoulders and straight, extra-long sleeves. Twisted seams at the front to create a tapered silhouette, and an asymmetric hem.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0789400001', '0789400', 'Hunter Super Skinny Check Blaz', 'Blazer', 'Garment Upper body', 'Check', 'Dark Grey', 'Dark', 'Blazer S&T', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Dressed', 'Single-breasted jacket in a stretch weave with narrow notch lapels, a chest pocket, welt front pockets and two inner pockets. Two buttons at the front, decorative buttons at the cuffs and a single back vent. Lined. Super Skinny Fit – a shorter style that shapes in at the chest and tapers sharply at the waist. This combined with narrow shoulders and sleeves creates a completely fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0);
