('0795706003', '0795706', 'Santa highwaist with bow', 'Underwear bottom', 'Underwear', 'Solid', 'Dark Red', 'Dark', 'Expressive Lingerie', 'Lingeries/Tights', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Lingerie', 'Under-, Nightwear', 'Waist-high briefs in lace with a V-shaped waist, and cut-out section at the back with wide satin ribbon ties. Lined gusset and a high cut at the back.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0795714002', '0795714', 'Jaqueline dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Other Blue', 'Bright', 'Blouse & Dress', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Trend', 'Blouses', 'Calf-length dress in an airy, textured, patterned cotton weave with adjustable spaghetti shoulder straps that cross at the back and a V-neck with a tie detail and small opening at the front. Concealed zip in one side, a seam below the bust with pleats, and a flared skirt with lots of volume. Lined bodice.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0795720003', '0795720', 'POW Fall out dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Light Beige', 'Dusty Light', 'Woven top', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'H&M+', 'Blouses', 'Calf-length dress in softly draping satin with a sheen. V-neck, wide ties that cross at the front and tie at the back, long gathered sleeves and wide cuffs with covered buttons. Seam at the waist, a concealed zip at the back and a flared skirt with a seam and wide flounce at the hem. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0795761001', '0795761', 'Janice EMB dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Embroidery', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Projects Dresses', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Projects', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Dress in airy chiffon with embroidery on the front, a small stand-up collar, an opening with a button at the back of the neck, and a deeper opening at the front. Long sleeves with a flounce half-way down and elastication at the cuffs. Seam with concealed elastication at the waist. Jersey-lined front and a jersey underskirt.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0795763001', '0795763', 'Julius dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Embroidery', 'Light Pink', 'Dusty Light', 'Dress', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Tailoring', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Short, straight-cut dress in pattern-weave fabric with a sheen decorated with plastic sparkly stones front and back. Boat neck and 3/4-length sleeves. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0795771001', '0795771', 'OC Prancer JS', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Projects Dresses', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Projects', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Playsuit in softly draping fabric with a V-neck and wrapover front with a concealed press-stud and ties at the waist. Cut-out section at the back, a wide flounce over the shoulders that continues down the front, and flounces at the hems. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0795771002', '0795771', 'OC Prancer JS', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Glittering/Metallic', 'Beige', 'Medium Dusty', 'Projects Dresses', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Projects', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Playsuit in softly draping fabric with a V-neck and wrapover front with a concealed press-stud and ties at the waist. Cut-out section at the back, a wide flounce over the shoulders that continues down the front, and flounces at the hems. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0795774001', '0795774', 'Eva poolslide SG', 'Sandals', 'Shoes', 'Application/3D', 'Light Pink', 'Dusty Light', 'Kids Girl Shoes', 'Children Accessories, Swimwear', 'Baby/Children', 'Kids & Baby Shoes', 'Shoes', 'Pool shoes with a padded, rainbow-coloured fabric strap (sizes 7-9 also with an elastic heel strap) and fluted soles.', NULL, 0, 0);
