('0795776001', '0795776', 'OC Elf Mesh Dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Projects Dresses', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Projects', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Calf-length dress in embroidered mesh with a smocked, frilled collar and opening with buttons at the back of the neck. Long raglan sleeves with wide, smocked cuffs and a smocked seam with a frill trim at the waist. V-neck underdress in airy jersey with adjustable spaghetti shoulder straps.', NULL, 0, 0),
